## Purpose

The Twin Engine tunnel connects the local Mac to Cloudflare's network, exposing:

1. **Home GPU inference** (Ollama) — zero-cost 70B model for CLINICAL/TENSION queries
2. **XTTS-v2 TTS** (future) — voice-cloned speech synthesis as a second TTS node

This makes the Mac a reliable, always-reachable sovereign inference + voice node without port forwarding, dynamic DNS, or firewall rules.

